cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  qtt_dlrx_simple: Time integration of quantized tensor trains
  using the interpolative dynamical low-rank approximation
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the
  associated paper (see preferred-citation).
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Erika
    family-names: Ye
    affiliation: Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory
  - given-names: Chao
    family-names: Yang
    affiliation: Lawrence Berkeley National Laboratory
repository-code: 'https://github.com/er9/qtt_dlrx_simple'
abstract: >-
  Research code implementing quantized tensor train (QTT) data
  structures and interpolative dynamical low-rank approximation
  (DLRA) time integrators for hyperbolic PDEs, including the
  Vlasov, Boltzmann, Burgers, and Maxwell equations.
keywords:
  - quantized tensor trains
  - QTT
  - dynamical low-rank approximation
  - DLRA
  - tensor networks
  - Vlasov equation
  - matrix product states
